the n0 is tapeecho samplerate=eighth
the n1 is ar samplerate=eighth attack=0.326 release=0.02
the n2 is svf samplerate=eighth
the n3 is lorenz samplerate=eighth
the n4 is phasor samplerate=quarter
fader3 -> n0.feedback
n2.band -> n0.wow
n0.wet -> n0.wow
button1 -> n1
n4 -35> n1.attack
n1 -> n1.release
n2.band -35> n1.release
n2.band -> n2
n1 -> n2.cutoff
n2.band ?> n2.res
play -> n4.reset
n1 -> left
n2 -> out
n3 -> right
n4 -> right
n3 -> leds
